{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は昨日UPしようと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記事を書いたまま、UPし忘れてました；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すいません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/34283_kkx26kqr.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の「乃木どこ?」で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正式に発表になったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、暫定ではありますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 キャプテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に任命して頂きました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表時の様子が放送されていましたが、名前を呼ばれた時はかなりビックリしました(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚いてる様子も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まとまらない意気込みも←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッチリ放送されていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し落ち込んだのは、ここだけのお話です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/997f725aa948b7987ffcd287241e0b70.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のキャプテン任命について。皆様、メンバーそれぞれ色々なことを思ったでしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「キャプテン」って、つくるモノじゃなくて、自然とグループ内で確立していくモノだと思うんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に沢山の時間を共有することで、自然と生まれる「チームワーク」があり、気づいたらチームをまとめる人間がいて「キャプテン」という役職が当てられる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういった自然な流れの中で生まれるモノを無理矢理決めてしまう事に少し不安があります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームがまとまるのか不安。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か言って、メンバーにどう思われるのか?と考えるだけで不安。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌われるんじゃないか不安。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「暫定」て言葉が怖い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑この言葉…乃木坂はお約束化してますね(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場ではキャプテンの役目が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地味に多く、昨日のＭＪでもひとりでワタワタしてました；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ慣れません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/86993e31497880b65f6d369ca1d979d4.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、昨日のＭＪは４８グループの皆さんと一緒に仕事をさせて頂いて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組のスタジオ収録中、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の席から良い感じに高橋みなみさんが見えまして…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさにキャプテンの鏡となる方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コレは今世紀最大のチャンスやぁ〜!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりげな〜く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガッツリ拝見してきました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石は高みなさん…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始凄いしか思えない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見習いたいところが沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、桜井のキャプテンは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高橋みなみさんとは、また違うタイプのキャプテンになるかなぁ?と思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/997f725aa948b7987ffcd287241e0b70.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は自分の中で理想としている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテン像はあるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるけど、ちゃんとそれが出来るのかどうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/moco46.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のキャプテン任命は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとって大きなチャンスだと思うので、このチャンスを活かせるように頑張りたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/8b4b921533be6d268d7c50c073d1f4b8.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/decoemo42.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからない事、知らない事沢山あるので…皆さんアドバイスなど、してもらえたら嬉しいです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで力を合わせて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46を世界に一つだけの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループにしていきましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/decoemo1301.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/decoemo42.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/07/1d08409d51b249785f6a4b18bda3290a.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井 玲香"}],"source":"archive"}